":"大長公主","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003090","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m027-0049","start":49,"end":52,"surface":"陳皇后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003110","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m027-0056","start":56,"end":59,"surface":"衛子夫","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003106","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m027-0074","start":74,"end":77,"surface":"陳皇后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003110","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m027-0091","start":91,"end":94,"surface":"陳皇后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003110","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m027-0097","start":97,"end":100,"surface":"衛子夫","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003106","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi","book_id":"b-shiji-049","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-049-waiqi"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:p029","text":"衛子夫已立為皇后，先是衛長君死，乃以衛青為將軍，擊胡有功，封為長平侯。青三子在襁褓中，皆封為列侯。及衛皇后所謂姊衛少兒，少兒生子霍去病，以軍功封冠軍侯，號驃騎將軍。青號大將軍。立衛皇后子據為太子。衛氏枝屬以軍功起家，五人為侯。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m029-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"衛子夫","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003106","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m029-0011","start":11,"end":14,"surface":"衛長君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003107","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m029-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"衛青","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003108","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m029-0035","start":35,"end":36,"surface":"青","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003108","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m029-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"三子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、集體、制度稱號或待核短稱；不補姓名或年表。"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m029-0050","start":50,"end":53,"surface":"衛皇后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003106","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m029-0056","start":56,"end":59,"surface":"衛少兒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003111","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m029-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"少兒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003111","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m029-0064","start":64,"end":67,"surface":"霍去病","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003112","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m029-0082","start":82,"end":83,"surface":"青","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003108","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m029-0084","start":84,"end":87,"surface":"大將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003108","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m029-0089","start":89,"end":92,"surface":"衛皇后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003106","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m029-0093","start":93,"end":94,"surface":"據","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003109","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m029-0108","start":108,"end":110,"surface":"五人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、集體、制度稱號或待核短稱；不補姓名或年表。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi","book_id":"b-shiji-049","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-049-waiqi"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:p030","text":"及衛后色衰，趙之王夫人幸，有子，為齊王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m030-0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"衛后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003106","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m030-0008","start":8,"end":11,"surface":"王夫人","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003113","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m030-0014","start":14,"end":15,"surface":"子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、集體、制度稱號或待核短稱；不補姓名或年表。"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m030-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"齊王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003138","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi","book_id":"b-shiji-049","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-049-waiqi"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:p036","text":"衛子夫立為皇后，后弟衛青字仲卿，以大將軍封為長平侯。四子，長子伉為侯世子，侯世子常侍中，貴幸。其三弟皆封為侯，各千三百戶，一曰陰安侯，二曰發干侯，三曰宜春侯，貴震天下。天下歌之曰：「生男無喜，生女無怒，獨不見衛子夫霸天下！」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"witness_appended_chu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m036-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"衛子夫","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003106","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m036-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"衛青","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003108","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m036-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"仲卿","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003108","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m036-0017","start":17,"end":20,"surface":"大將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003108","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m036-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"四子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、集體、制度稱號或待核短稱；不補姓名或年表。"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m036-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"長子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、集體、制度稱號或待核短稱；不補姓名或年表。"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m036-0031","start":31,"end":32,"surface":"伉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003141","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m036-0033","start":33,"end":36,"surface":"侯世子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、集體、制度稱號或待核短稱；不補姓名或年表。"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m036-0037","start":37,"end":40,"surface":"侯世子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、集體、制度稱號或待核短稱；不補姓名或年表。"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m036-0048","start":48,"end":50,"s